    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>There are various on-campus accommodation options at the University of Alabama, Birmingham, including traditional residence halls offering an archetypal student experience. Blazer Hall and Camp Hall provide double occupancy rooms and shared community bathrooms. Blount Hall is a suite-style residence hall that offers four-bedroom suites with shared bathrooms and a common living area. The Heights offers one and two-bedroom apartments with a full kitchen, living area and private bathroom.</p><p>There is also a range of off-campus housing options near the University comprising houses, apartments and townhouses. Some of the scholarships offered by UAB cover living costs to support students.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
